  "body": "E.g., for <input type=number value=1 max=0> a stepUp() method call must\nbe ignored as otherwise the value would go down.\n\nThis fixes an issue that was reported by @jwatt in\nhttps://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=27432 against the HTML\nstandard, but due to the wrong component being used never reached the\neditors until I stumbled upon it.\n\nThe variable name is taken from Gecko:\nhttps://mxr.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/html/HTMLInputElement.cpp.\n",
